{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_001","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Exporting for macOS\n===================","location_hint":"paragraph 2","char_start":30,"char_end":69,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_002","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"This page describes how to export a Godot project to macOS.\n If you're looking to compile editor or export template binaries from source instead,\n read :ref:`doc_compiling_for_macos`.","location_hint":"paragraph 4","char_start":86,"char_end":269,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_003","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"macOS apps exported with the official export templates are exported as a single \"Universal 2\" binary ``.app`` bundle, a folder with a specific structure which stores the executable, libraries and all the project files.\nThis bundle can be exported as is, packed in a ZIP archive, or packed in a DMG disk image (only supported when exporting from macOS).\n`Universal binaries for macOS support both Intel x86_64 and ARM64 (Apple Silicon) architectures <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/apple-silicon/building-a-universal-macos-binary>`__.","location_hint":"paragraph 5","char_start":271,"char_end":815,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_004","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. warning::\n Due to file system limitations, ``.app`` bundles exported from Windows lack the \n ``executable`` flag and won't run on macOS. Projects exported as ``.zip`` are not \n affected by this issue. To run ``.app`` bundles exported from Windows on macOS,\n transfer the ``.app`` to a device running macOS or Linux and use the\n ``chmod +x {executable_name}`` terminal command to add the ``executable`` permission.\n The main executable located in the ``Contents/MacOS/`` subfolder, as well\n as optional helper executables in the ``Contents/Helpers/`` subfolder, should have\n the ``executable`` permission for the ``.app`` bundle to be valid.","location_hint":"paragraph 6","char_start":817,"char_end":1460,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_005","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Download the Godot export templates. Use the Godot menu: ``Editor > Manage Export Templates``.\n- A valid and unique ``Bundle identifier`` should be set in the ``Application`` section of the export options.","location_hint":"paragraph 8","char_start":1489,"char_end":1696,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_006","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"A valid bundle ID can only contain alphanumeric characters, hyphens, and periods (``A-Z``, ``a-z``, ``0-9``, ``-``, and ``.``).\n Apple recommends using reverse-DNS format (e.g. ``com.example.your-game``) of a domain you own, so that your bundle ID is guaranteed to be unique.\n Bundle IDs are case-insensitive. See `CFBundleIdentifier <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/bundleresources/information-property-list/cfbundleidentifier>`__.","location_hint":"paragraph 10","char_start":1710,"char_end":2152,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_007","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Projects exported without code signing and notarization will be blocked by Gatekeeper if they are downloaded from unknown sources, see the :ref:`Running Godot apps on macOS <doc_running_on_macos>` page for more information.","location_hint":"paragraph 12","char_start":2169,"char_end":2392,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_008","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Code signing and notarization\n-----------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 13","char_start":2394,"char_end":2453,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_009","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"By default, macOS will run only applications that are signed and notarized. If you use any other signing configuration, see :ref:`Running Godot apps on macOS <doc_running_on_macos>` for workarounds.","location_hint":"paragraph 14","char_start":2455,"char_end":2653,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_010","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To notarize an app, you **must** have a valid `Apple Developer ID Certificate <https://developer.apple.com/>`__.","location_hint":"paragraph 15","char_start":2655,"char_end":2767,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_011","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you have an Apple Developer ID Certificate and exporting from macOS\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 16","char_start":2769,"char_end":2910,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_012","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Install `Xcode <https://developer.apple.com/xcode/>`__ command line tools and open Xcode at least once or run the ``sudo xcodebuild -license accept`` command to accept license agreement.","location_hint":"paragraph 17","char_start":2912,"char_end":3098,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_013","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To sign exported app\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","location_hint":"paragraph 18","char_start":3100,"char_end":3141,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_014","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Select ``Xcode codesign`` in the ``Code Signing > Codesign`` option.\n- Set valid Apple ID certificate identity (certificate \"Common Name\") in the ``Code Signing > Identity`` section.","location_hint":"paragraph 19","char_start":3143,"char_end":3327,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_015","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To notarize exported app\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","location_hint":"paragraph 20","char_start":3329,"char_end":3378,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_016","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Select ``Xcode altool`` in the ``Notarization > Notarization`` option.\n- Disable the ``Debugging`` entitlement.\n- Set valid Apple ID login / app. specific password or `App Store Connect <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appstoreconnectapi>`__ API UUID / Key in the ``Notarization`` section.","location_hint":"paragraph 21","char_start":3380,"char_end":3681,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_017","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"You can use the ``xcrun notarytool history`` command to check notarization status and use the ``xcrun notarytool log {ID}`` command to download the notarization log.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":3683,"char_end":3848,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_018","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you encounter notarization issues, see `Resolving common notarization issues <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing_macos_software_before_distribution/resolving_common_notarization_issues>`__ for more info.","location_hint":"paragraph 23","char_start":3850,"char_end":4083,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_019","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"After notarization is completed, `staple the ticket <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing_macos_software_before_distribution/customizing_the_notarization_workflow>`__ to the exported project.","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":4085,"char_end":4301,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_020","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you have an Apple Developer ID Certificate and exporting from Linux or Windows\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 25","char_start":4303,"char_end":4466,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_021","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Install `PyOxidizer rcodesign <https://github.com/indygreg/apple-platform-rs/tree/main/apple-codesign>`__, and configure the path to ``rcodesign`` in the ``Editor Settings > Export > macOS > rcodesign``.","location_hint":"paragraph 26","char_start":4468,"char_end":4671,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_022","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To sign exported app\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","location_hint":"paragraph 27","char_start":4673,"char_end":4714,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_023","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Select ``PyOxidizer rcodesign`` in the ``Code Signing > Codesign`` option.\n- Set valid Apple ID PKCS #12 certificate file and password in the ``Code Signing`` section.","location_hint":"paragraph 28","char_start":4716,"char_end":4885,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_024","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To notarize exported app\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","location_hint":"paragraph 29","char_start":4887,"char_end":4936,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_025","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Select ``PyOxidizer rcodesign`` in the ``Notarization > Notarization`` option.\n- Disable the ``Debugging`` entitlement.\n- Set valid `App Store Connect <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appstoreconnectapi>`__ API UUID / Key in the ``Notarization`` section.","location_hint":"paragraph 30","char_start":4938,"char_end":5204,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_026","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"You can use the ``rcodesign notary-log`` command to check notarization status.","location_hint":"paragraph 31","char_start":5206,"char_end":5284,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_027","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"After notarization is completed, use the ``rcodesign staple`` command to staple the ticket to the exported project.","location_hint":"paragraph 32","char_start":5286,"char_end":5401,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_028","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you do not have an Apple Developer ID Certificate\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 33","char_start":5403,"char_end":5508,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_029","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"- Select ``Built-in (ad-hoc only)`` in the ``Code Signing > Codesign`` option.\n- Select ``Disabled`` in the ``Notarization > Notarization`` option.","location_hint":"paragraph 34","char_start":5510,"char_end":5657,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_030","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"In this case Godot will use an ad-hoc signature, which will make running an exported app easier for the end users,\nsee the :ref:`Running Godot apps on macOS <doc_running_on_macos>` page for more information.","location_hint":"paragraph 35","char_start":5659,"char_end":5866,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_031","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Signing Options\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 36","char_start":5868,"char_end":5899,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_032","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Option | Description |\n+==============================+===================================================================================================+\n| Codesign | Tool to use for code signing. |\n+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Identity | The \"Full Name\" or \"Common Name\" of the signing identity, store in the macOS keychain.","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":5901,"char_end":6469,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_033","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[1]_ |\n+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Certificate File | The PKCS #12 certificate file.","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":6470,"char_end":6661,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_034","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[2]_ |\n+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Certificate Password | Password for the certificate file.","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":6662,"char_end":6861,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_035","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[2]_ |\n+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Custom Options | Array of command line arguments passed to the code signing tool. |\n+------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":6862,"char_end":7220,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_036","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. [1] This option is visible only when signing with Xcode codesign.\n.. [2] These options are visible only when signing with PyOxidizer rcodesign.","location_hint":"paragraph 38","char_start":7222,"char_end":7368,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_037","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Notarization Options\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 39","char_start":7370,"char_end":7411,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_038","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Option | Description |\n+====================+===================================================================================================================================================================================+\n| Notarization | Tool to use for notarization. |\n+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Apple ID Name | Apple ID account name (email address).","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":7413,"char_end":8152,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_039","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[3]_ |\n+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Apple ID Password | Apple ID app-specific password.","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":8153,"char_end":8416,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_040","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"See `Using app-specific passwords <https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT204397>`__ to enable two-factor authentication and create app password.","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":8417,"char_end":8557,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_041","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[3]_ |\n+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Apple Team ID | Team ID (\"Organization Unit\"), if your Apple ID belongs to multiple teams (optional).","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":8558,"char_end":8871,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_042","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"[3]_ |\n+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| API UUID | Apple `App Store Connect <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appstoreconnectapi>`__ API issuer UUID. |\n+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| API Key | Apple `App Store Connect <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appstoreconnectapi>`__ API key. |\n+--------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- …","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":8872,"char_end":9724,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_043","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"You should set either Apple ID Name/Password or App Store Connect API UUID/Key.","location_hint":"paragraph 42","char_start":9738,"char_end":9817,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_044","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. [3] These options are visible only when notarizing with Xcode altool.","location_hint":"paragraph 43","char_start":9819,"char_end":9891,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_045","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"See `Notarizing macOS Software Before Distribution <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/notarizing_macos_software_before_distribution?language=objc>`__ for more info.","location_hint":"paragraph 44","char_start":9893,"char_end":10074,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_046","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Hardened Runtime Entitlements\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 46","char_start":10103,"char_end":10162,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_047","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Hardened Runtime entitlements manage security options and resource access policy.\nSee `Hardened Runtime <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/hardened_runtime?language=objc>`__ for more info.","location_hint":"paragraph 47","char_start":10164,"char_end":10369,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_048","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Entitlement | Description |\n+=======================================+==================================================================================================================================================================================================+\n| Allow JIT Code Execution [4]_ | Allows creating writable and executable memory for JIT code.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":10371,"char_end":10969,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_049","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them according to the add-on documentation. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Allow Unsigned Executable Memory [4]_ | Allows creating writable and executable memory without JIT restrictions.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":10970,"char_end":11443,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_050","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them according to the add-on documentation. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Allow DYLD Environment Variables [4]_ | Allows app to uss dynamic linker environment variables to inject code.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":11444,"char_end":11915,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_051","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"If you are using add-ons with dynamic or self-modifying native code, enable them according to the add-on documentation. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Disable Library Validation | Allows app to load arbitrary libraries and frameworks.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":11916,"char_end":12360,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_052","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Enable it if you are using GDExtension add-ons or ad-hoc signing, or want to support user-provided external add-ons. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Audio Input | Enable if you need to use the microphone or other audio input sources, if it's enabled you should also provide usage message in the `privacy/microphone_usage_description` option. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Camera | …","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":12361,"char_end":15678,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_053","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"This entitlement should be disabled for production export. |\n+---------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":15679,"char_end":15976,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_054","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. [4] The ``Allow JIT Code Execution``, ``Allow Unsigned Executable Memory`` and ``Allow DYLD Environment Variables`` entitlements are always enabled for the Godot Mono exports, and are not visible in the export options.\n.. [5] These features aren't supported by Godot out of the box, enable them only if you are using add-ons which require them.\n.. [6] To notarize an app, you must disable the ``Debugging`` entitlement.","location_hint":"paragraph 49","char_start":15978,"char_end":16400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_055","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"App Sandbox Entitlement\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~","location_hint":"paragraph 50","char_start":16402,"char_end":16449,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_056","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"The App Sandbox restricts access to user data, networking and devices.\nSandboxed apps can't access most of the file system, can't use custom file dialogs and execute binaries (using ``OS.execute`` and ``OS.create_process``) outside the ``.app`` bundle.\nSee `App Sandbox <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/app_sandbox?language=objc>`__ for more info.","location_hint":"paragraph 51","char_start":16451,"char_end":16817,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_057","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To distribute an app through the App Store, you must enable the App Sandbox.","location_hint":"paragraph 53","char_start":16831,"char_end":16907,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_058","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Entitlement | Description |\n+===================================+======================================================================================================================================+\n| Enabled | Enables App Sandbox. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Network Server | Enable to allow app to listen for incoming network connections. |\n+-----------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- …","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":16909,"char_end":18072,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_059","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"This entitlement is required to use wired controllers. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Device Bluetooth | Enable to allow app to interact with Bluetooth devices.","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":18073,"char_end":18379,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_060","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"This entitlement is required to use wireless controllers. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Files Downloads [7]_ | Allows read or write access to the user's \"Downloads\" folder. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Files Pictures [7]_ | Allows read or write access to the user's \"Pictures\" folder. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Files Music [7]_ | Allows read or write acc …","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":18380,"char_end":19722,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_061","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"To gain access, a folder must be selected from the native file dialog by the user. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Helper Executable | List of helper executables to embedded to the app bundle.","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":19723,"char_end":20060,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_062","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Sandboxed app are limited to execute only these executable. |\n+-----------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+","location_hint":"paragraph 54","char_start":20061,"char_end":20295,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_063","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. [7] You can optionally provide usage messages for various folders in the `privacy/*_folder_usage_description` options.","location_hint":"paragraph 55","char_start":20297,"char_end":20418,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_064","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"You can override default entitlements by selecting custom entitlements file, in this case all other entitlement are ignored.","location_hint":"paragraph 57","char_start":20432,"char_end":20556,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_065","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"Environment variables\n---------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 58","char_start":20558,"char_end":20601,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_066","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":"You can use the following environment variables to set export options outside of\nthe editor. During the export process, these override the values that you set in\nthe export menu.","location_hint":"paragraph 59","char_start":20603,"char_end":20781,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_03cb99fe6df9_067","source_id":"src_03cb99fe6df9","source_hash":"81b0f6b41fe9dca67089d3df19269758684e392a403eba858c295dec2dba05a4","text":".. list-table:: macOS export environment variables\n :header-rows: 1","location_hint":"paragraph 60","char_start":20783,"char_end":20850,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:01:56.514Z"}
